{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "da69ac3b8ed709600621537f474594c725fc3ccc979724e6c581387a739fc316", "ja": "コラボ公演は、熱狂のうちに幕を下ろした。\nお客さん達だけでなく、自分達までおかしく\nなっちゃったかも、と語る一同。変化を続け\nるアイドル達の姿に、プロデューサーも無限\nの可能性を感じるのだった。", "zh": "联动公演在狂热中落下帷幕。众人谈道，或许不只是观众们，连自己也变得有些奇怪了。看着不断变化的偶像们，制作人也感受到了无限的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "86d96aec3206c20d156b9427fb3395e57a7f796b1fe0d7e9a109508049d5ae5f", "ja": "（コラボ公演は、すごい盛り上がりだ。\n拍手と歓声が、鳴り止む気配がない！）", "zh": "（联动公演的气氛太热烈了。掌声和欢呼声完全没有停下来的迹象！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "91162b1ce667b0e43cb3c45d7ac8ed3b8de4c1ca7367030c72da65bcc3a508ce", "ja": "みなさ～ん。私たちのライブで\nおかしくなっちゃいましたか～？", "zh": "各位～！看我们的演出看得都兴奋过头了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "950245a2e74aae19522275491ee28a667eb44462b57a820fd8bea532e200e1f2", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァーッ！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "faa7d21f723e7c09bba40bccffdead6d4727cab3f570c5c789b06325cb17bf46", "ja": "アハッ、なってるなってる♪\nこんなに盛り上がってくれて、アリガトー！", "zh": "啊哈，成功了成功了♪\n谢谢大家气氛这么热烈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1004_205xxx", "source_sha256": "c16ff7bd46abae16606fc063fb43ad815fb0290eaddfe2e1d35232d5e1b9eee5", "ja": "みんないい感じにフェロモンが出てるね～。\n志希ちゃんも大満足の実験結果だよ～！", "zh": "大家都散发着很棒的费洛蒙呢～  \n志希也对这个实验结果满意极了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1005_204xxx", "source_sha256": "7529e5f9e9a6470343fa166852361b0ecc4a2b940be7d24a975a045601a41bb0", "ja": "また劇場に呼んでねー！　約束だよ！　それじゃー！\nまたいつか会う日まで、メルシーユー♪", "zh": "下次还要叫我来剧场哦——！说好了！那就——！下次再见啦，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "950245a2e74aae19522275491ee28a667eb44462b57a820fd8bea532e200e1f2", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァーッ！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "36b801d9e37ba23e60a384c506dabc56a70e6b7b702b8a0f6017b5cd82efc78d", "ja": "{$P$}っ！\nエヘヘ、ワタシ達の公演、どうだったかナ？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n诶嘿嘿，我们的演出，感觉怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "041c484e0bdb888249abc72fecccb74c796cf966f03e9bc804caaef7deb7d074", "ja": "エレナ、みんな、お疲れさま！　二つの色がキレイに\n溶け合った、新鮮で素敵な公演だったよ！", "zh": "艾莉娜，还有大家，辛苦了！两种色彩美丽地交融在一起，真是一场清新又精彩的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1009_205xxx", "source_sha256": "49cd851e5eaf7fee4fdaf5d83102935ab14b07a24afad9501895202f9a78687e", "ja": "お客さん達だけじゃなくて、こっちもおかしく\nなっちゃったみたい。みんなも、あたしも♪", "zh": "不只是观众，连这边好像也变得奇怪起来了。大家，还有我也是♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "1e91b72fa0fe7fc2fcd7bb2f54a3ba601f9ad9eca8a0361f8e4d4ffcdf17d6fc", "ja": "私もいつもと違う、不思議な気持ちです～。\nこれも化学反応でしょうか～？", "zh": "我也有种和平时不一样的奇妙感觉～。这也是化学反应吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1011_204xxx", "source_sha256": "97e7cf35157a2b3201dcee90290f0e31fded5283db734e92ca02c831c5927174", "ja": "シキちゃんとふたりのライブも好きだけど、\n4人のライブもいいね♪　人数も楽しさも2倍だもん！", "zh": "我也喜欢和志希两个人的演唱会，不过4人的演唱会也很棒呢♪ 人数和快乐都是2倍嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "82ec58c2ce22976c39d068d5e6d8e4d95c193d30e5915402fcbac798b89df802", "ja": "それって、もっと人数増えたら、\nもっと楽しくなっちゃうってコト？", "zh": "也就是说，如果人数再增加，岂不是会变得更开心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "5edae65029f0e79a6609a32b9814acd00ae5daf67b4ed4d398d7b8f7de61cb8f", "ja": "そうかもしれませんね～。\n楽しさは、きっと無限大ですから～。", "zh": "也许是这样呢～  \n因为快乐一定是无限大的嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1014_205xxx", "source_sha256": "4f7d1e9d984bdace0cc41658093c3501f20d21fa0d3f2e07600d825c6c13376c", "ja": "そだね～♪　あたし『レイジー・レイジー』は\nもう完成だと思ってたけど、違ったな。", "zh": "对呀～♪　我还以为《レイジー・レイジー》已经完成了，看来不是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1015_205xxx", "source_sha256": "9b999b16f170878ae8a22d8abd5467dc3fdd7c3d40be504cb897c5ec99367aca", "ja": "シゲキひとつで、まだまだ変化できる……うん！\nパーフェクトな実験結果！", "zh": "只要一点刺激，就还能继续变化……嗯！\n完美的实验结果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1016_205xxx", "source_sha256": "df38e6f087fa6035970ba506fc5253a4c03b57d16f072f588b062b9c6077814d", "ja": "んんー、なんだかウチの事務所のみんなとも、\nライブしたくなっちゃったなー。", "zh": "嗯——不知怎么的，突然也想和事务所的大家一起演出呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1017_204xxx", "source_sha256": "e4578e55be4ac17196c4195e298c525a9594d4c0c978fd71ea085a0af7d59bc7", "ja": "ワオ！　どうしたのシキちゃん、どっかぶつけた？\n今日はすっごく素直だよ～。おかしくなっちゃった～？", "zh": "哇！怎么了，志希，撞到哪儿了吗？今天特别坦率呢～。该不会是哪里坏掉了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1018_205xxx", "source_sha256": "f0c94d118130c73a961ab7b172c715bf772a3d4afc8d138fbb6d9b19fd1a2316", "ja": "ふふーん、実験が成功したからね～♪\n今日はご機嫌志希ちゃんなのだよ～。", "zh": "哼哼～因为实验成功了嘛～♪今天的志希心情超好哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1019_205xxx", "source_sha256": "8b703e947e38246c3c9c9e870974ef4d2b80426a011f5b99690ba690c6eaf44f", "ja": "あ、ねえフレちゃん、ウチのプロデューサーに\nおねだりして、劇場建ててもらおうよ！", "zh": "啊，对了，芙蕾，我们去求求我家的制作人，让他帮我们盖一座剧场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1020_204xxx", "source_sha256": "1cc23bbbb6bf338355b979c878dfed5bc8d727a0d51fec562782c909f130720e", "ja": "いいねシキちゃん！　みんなをお菓子で\nバイシューして、署名とか集めちゃお！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "好主意，志希！我们用点心\n来收买大家，搜集签名吧！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a76776ce9f47e9a7f247b96d2e1c357cfecef33ffa3dfb3bd54688fac879f15e", "ja": "本当に、どこのプロデューサーも大変なんだな……。\nそれより、早く着替えてきたらどうだ？", "zh": "真的，不管是哪位制作人都很辛苦啊……  \n比起这个，你还是赶紧去换衣服吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1022_205xxx", "source_sha256": "e8e86608016a9a3903549df493a1845bebab52428e8be95d55662e7abb5d52c8", "ja": "え～、あたしもう少しこのままが良いんだけどなー。\nほら、みんないい感じの匂いしてるし～。ハスハス。", "zh": "哎～我还想再保持这样一会儿嘛——。你看，大家身上的味道都好好闻～。吸吸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "8f482c6aceae3518dc17c1d826c0ffc23ace27470789f42ada5c3f8bbf1a0c05", "ja": "うふふふふ、志希さん、くすぐったいですよ～？\nもう、本当に猫さんみたいですね～。", "zh": "呵呵呵，志希小姐，好痒呀～？\n真是的，简直就像猫咪一样呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1024_205xxx", "source_sha256": "3c3fb1b66b603dc7915164154981b71f1f07113f65c44bc543a7da842f354371", "ja": "にゃはは～？", "zh": "喵哈哈～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1025_204xxx", "source_sha256": "d6bf719145e497e60d2bc030a14c13e4b6522049aac9b1f70f2782ad0028f22c", "ja": "あら～かわいい志希にゃんですこと。ほらほら、\nこっちの匂いは芳しいぞ～。", "zh": "哎呀～好可爱的志希喵啊。来来，\n这边的气味可是很香的哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1026_205xxx", "source_sha256": "f2045a52229c81869babed1a3e049d4460c9c5fced7b1888f34d9d937ff85aad", "ja": "ハスハス～♪", "zh": "嗅嗅～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1027_204xxx", "source_sha256": "83c14d2608c259d35bc3bdac36bc0b96d8aeab35adad5acebff3a6cc23ced79f", "ja": "はいはーい志希にゃん、こっちこっち～。\nじゃまた後でね、{$P$}。アデュー。", "zh": "好嘞好嘞，志希喵，这边这边～。\n那待会儿见，{$P$}。再会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "7c948456c366ec0f3bbaf478a4258ebba4412f0ee7626c99d30ce4a586c5811d", "ja": "……エヘヘ、ホントに面白いふたりだよネ！\n出会った時から公演が終わるまで、ずーっと！", "zh": "……嘿嘿，真的是两个很有趣的人呢！\n从相遇开始，一直到公演结束，始终都是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "bf5cec36bf67d90af1cae0c152020de6619992fad798b1899c6fffbc4bb9ae45", "ja": "そうですね～。\n本当に、風のような人たちです～。", "zh": "是啊～。他们真的都是像风一样的人呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "2f96d96899911fac0e47447b2a9d34d0f28965652093ad83c9525fbd698e491b", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さん、エレナさん。\n宣伝の時は、心配をかけてすみませんでした～。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生、艾蕾娜。\n宣传的时候，让你担心了，真是对不起～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "6bc6530b8ff06966911d1356ef09104cc057675fa4c8f1a0adbbe0ad4d9421b4", "ja": "ウウン、いいヨ～！　だってまた会えたもん。\nあの時はワタシ、ミヤのこといーっぱい考えたノ。", "zh": "嗯，没关系哦～！因为我们又见面了嘛。\n那时候，我满脑子想的都是美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "45d1f8258a4ef003e7cd634a26261b543d2b1c5dd266143f85927d6fbfa29968", "ja": "そしたらミヤのコト、今までよりもーっと近くに\n感じるようになったんだヨ♪", "zh": "这样一来，我就觉得和美也比以前更加亲近了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_07_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "3c0163ebff222714ef4ad0452a9cc2799d9e408fe4225101758dfbc78bd50b75", "ja": "そうでしたか～。では、前より息がピッタリになった\n気がしたのは、そのせいかもしれませんね～？", "zh": "原来如此～。那么，感觉比以前更加合拍了，也许就是因为这个吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
